# Title: Tamper Windows Defender Remove-MpPreference
# ID: 07e3cb2c-0608-410d-be4b-1511cb1a0448
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-08-05
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
# Description: Detects attempts to remove Windows Defender configurations using the 'MpPreference' cmdlet
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((CommandLine CONTAIN "Remove-MpPreference") AND ((CommandLine CONTAIN "-ControlledFolderAccessProtectedFolders " OR CommandLine CONTAIN "-AttackSurfaceReductionRules_Ids " OR CommandLine CONTAIN "-AttackSurfaceReductionRules_Actions " OR CommandLine CONTAIN "-CheckForSignaturesBeforeRunningScan ")))
